 Dean- Post Graduate Studies 






 The Dean Post Graduate Studies office came into existence in the year 1987 with the establishment of the university to run Masters&#8217; and Ph.D. Programmes in Agriculture, Home
 Science and Agribusiness Management. All Masters&#8217; and Ph.D. degree programmes offered by the University are coordinated by the Dean, Post-Graduate Studies, through the Deans
 of different faculties and Heads of the Department of different colleges. The students are admitted through Pre-PG test, Pre Ph.D. test & norms set by concerned faculty. For a pos
t-graduate degree, every student has to study a package of courses work and do research work with thesis in prescribe time limit. 




 MAJOR ACHIEVEMENTS 

 “POST GRADUATE STUDIES REGULATIONS-2016” was published with the latest rules and regulations of SKRAU, Bikaner for M.Sc. and Ph.D. 
 Anti-plagiarism software has been installed in the University for M.Sc. and Ph. D. students to improve the quality of research. 
 First time in history of SKRAU following events were conducted- 
&#8220;BEST THESIS AWARD&#8221; was given on 5th September 2023. 
&#8220;BEST TEACHER AWARD&#8221; was given on 5th September 2023. 
&#8220;PG BOS&#8221; was conducted on 22 May 2024. 





